ear or buffs you need at that moment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/39075f4e1470a4826165ed160b196799.avif?t=1759321005\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As mentioned earlier, bosses have powerful unique skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome their challenges through skillful tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/1d7b38695d94ce6108d639df1a86e333.poster.avif?t=1759321005\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/1d7b38695d94ce6108d639df1a86e333.webm?t=1759321005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The Bunker offers players various strategic options.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your account level increases, bring the beer you receive to Mr. Stan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/07e4094869823e305c72ad685999955b.avif?t=1759321005\" width=621 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you can upgrade your character\u2019s stats or learn new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor your upgrades to match your weapon preference or play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Made a mistake? No worries\u2014generous Mr. Stan will reset your skills for free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for new weapons? <br>Visit the weapon shop run by retired veteran hunter Miss. Lee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/c1e42c480e6dbbe12ba625929ff1e6b4.avif?t=1759321005\" width=621 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find powerful upgraded weapons and hidden gear here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also prepare weapons for your next dungeon challenge in advance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Miss. Lee occasionally runs sales\u2014so don\u2019t forget to check in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the Hunter Network, you can unlock and play as new playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/extras/abc93ac53bf71d3d9b611057a3336ac6.avif?t=1759321005\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These new hunters all have different skills and powerful unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enhance them further using awakening items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may not know who\u2019s the strongest,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but you\u2019ll definitely find the one that fits your play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Cheese Burger Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966010/8e3b3c33dffd20c7498ef0c5f80ac3dd7a9b5926/header.jpg?t=1759321005","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966010/1280798977/9a06debe69b09eb53cd1a2ee019ac7c0cd2bd639/1756872358/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756873062","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966010/1280798977/9a06debe69b09eb53cd1a2ee019ac7c0cd2bd639/1756872358